Bundled skill recommendations
============================

Add recommended skills here as either:

  <name>/SKILL.md

or a flat:

  <name>.md

Each file needs YAML frontmatter with `name` and `description`. The image
copies this directory to `/opt/dsh-seed/skills`. On first seed or explicit
state migration, missing bundles are copied into `$DSH_HOME/skills`; users may
edit or delete them. They are not scanned from `/opt`, are not part of the
mandatory auth boundary, and are not restored on every restart.

Do not put README.md here: the provider treats top-level `.md` files as flat
skill candidates and rejects them for missing frontmatter. This README has no
`.md` extension for that reason.
